{"page":366,"verses":[{"verse_key":"25:68","surah":25,"ayah":68,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَدْعُونَ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ إِلَـٰهًا ءَاخَرَ وَلَا يَقْتُلُونَ ٱلنَّفْسَ ٱلَّتِى حَرَّمَ ٱللَّهُ إِلَّا بِٱلْحَقِّ وَلَا يَزْنُونَ ۚ وَمَن يَفْعَلْ ذَٰلِكَ يَلْقَ أَثَامًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who never invoke any other deity beside God, nor take a life, which God has made sacred, except in the pursuit of justice, nor commit adultery. (Whoever does these things will face the penalties:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"invoke","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَـٰهًا","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāhan","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَاخَرَ","en_gloss":"another","transliteration":"ākhara","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَقْتُلُونَ","en_gloss":"[they] kill","transliteration":"yaqtulūna","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلنَّفْسَ","en_gloss":"the soul","transliteration":"l-nafsa","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":12,"ar":"حَرَّمَ","en_gloss":"Allah has forbidden","transliteration":"ḥarrama","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has forbidden","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"by right","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"25:68"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","trans